@startuml Pattern Observer Bus
autonumber
title Pattern: Event Bus (Pub-Sub)

box "Module A (Publisher)" #LightBlue
    participant "Generator" as Pub
end box

box "Infrastructure" #LightYellow
    participant "EventBus\n(Map<Type, List>)" as Bus
end box

box "Module B (Subscriber)" #LightGreen
    participant "Listener" as Sub
end box

== 1. Subscribe (Binding) ==
Sub -> Bus: subscribe(EventType.FIRE, this)
note right: Listener registers\nfor topic "FIRE"

== ... Time passes ... ==

== 2. Publish (Fire & Forget) ==
Pub -> Bus: publish(new Event(FIRE))
activate Bus
    
    note right of Bus
        Bus looks up listeners
        for key <b>EventType.FIRE</b>
    end note

    Bus -> Sub: handleEvent(event)
    activate Sub
    Sub --> Bus
    deactivate Sub

deactivate Bus
@enduml